  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「その場合、問題なのは花音さん……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「そうね。彼女はアイドルだけど、まだプロではないってことよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「心情的にも、技量的にも、まだ相方に……羽森さんに依存してる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_character",
    "id": "right"
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_character",
    "id": "left"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「その気持ちも、わかるのだけどね。依存と言えば聞こえはよくないけど、それは愛だもの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「世の中は、きっと理屈だけで回ってはいないのだわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「ふたりがいい、一緒に成長したい、離れたくない……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「その気持ちは、花音さんの相方への愛情は痛いほどにわかるわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「けれど、ずっとプロでやってきた羽森さんには、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「そんな花音さんの気持ちは『甘え』にしか思えないんでしょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「だから『こじれる』のよ。羽森さんは羽森さんで、ちょっと歪んだものを抱えているのよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「さぁ、ここで問題よ。こじれにこじれたこの現状を、打開できるかしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「壊れやすくも尊い女の子たちの心情も絡んでるぶん、わたくしには迂闊に手出しできない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「わたくし、どうも他人の気持ちを蔑ろにしがちなようだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「『生徒会長再任選挙』で懲りたわ、ううん思い知ったの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「だから、お兄さまに頼ったのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「この絡まりあって、こんがらがった因果を、彼女たちの抱えた事情を解きほぐすことができるかしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「もちろん、わたくしも打つ手は打つけどね。お兄さまにも、期待していてよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「何もできないお子ちゃまだったあの子を……ひまりを支え、勝利をもたらし、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「他にも様々な女の子たちの悩みを解決してきたお兄さまにはね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「どうか、いっしょに打開策を考えてくださらない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「願わくば……みんな笑顔で、ハッピーエンドを迎えられるように♪」"
  }
]